<title>UK: TABLE-Sainsbury year profit down 15 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sainsbury year profit down 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 8</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.0		   vs 26.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.8		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.3		   vs 12.1</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excepts     651		    vs 764</p>
<p> Turnover		   14,312		 vs 13,499</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 640.0 and 650.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Pretax profit after exceptionals was 609 million stg versus 712 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - J. Sainsbury Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
